{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "c7a1c5ec52993be3ad6ee6c14ba79db0dd6a15056cd4c39f37b785eb354376b9", "ja": "誰よりも熱く、強く", "zh": "比谁都要炙热、坚强", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0913129bb6e40c35d099d16ae812ce93039e54e8bd8454e928ef97f8db002908", "ja": "ミニライブの打ち合わせ当日。なじみの\r\nスタッフや初対面のアイドルと顔合わせする\r\n一同。そこで真と千早が『別格』だと評され\r\nたことに響は悔しさを見せるが、当の本人達\r\nは、素直に悔しさを表す響を称賛する。", "zh": "迷你演唱会开会当天。大家与熟悉的工作人员以及初次见面的偶像们碰面。真和千早被评价为“出类拔萃”，响对此感到不甘，但当事人却称赞了坦率表现出不甘的响。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7403c93e71ffeb03fcc917415c92e1eaa3ac9f170275f8850c8872a594f2feea", "ja": "（『ルナ』ミニライブの打ち合わせ。ライブに出場する\n他のユニットとの顔合わせも行われる予定だ）", "zh": "（『Luna』迷你演唱会的碰头会。还预定要和其他参加演出的组合见面）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9319f219d8c042f0937ee6fdfb1d5c6f619f28fb22e48a2d17bf298f3a1d6954", "ja": "（俺は別件があって付き添ってあげられないけど、\nみんなは、そろそろ現場に着いた頃かな……？）", "zh": "（我还有别的事，没法陪她们一起去，不过，她们差不多该到现场了吧……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "fe4356cd7bd03ce4f344cc51328a744506699d24f2813530d30cad222f4d7766", "ja": "おはようございます！　765PRO ALLSTARSの\n天体ユニット『ルナ』です！", "zh": "早上好！我是765PRO ALLSTARS的天体组合『ルナ』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1003_najiminosutaffu", "source_sha256": "dc3f12e4217ac3209a8fa78a63e2eac80841d1dbc78c3bac83b2217153b0b727", "ja": "あ、765プロさん、おはようございます！\n今回もよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "啊，765制作人，早上好！\n这次也请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "8428dfb98a8e6470021b433fac28fdc28c69a760829b85f25db3d6b9e8be186f", "ja": "あ、前にライブでお世話になったスタッフさん……！\nまたご一緒できるんですね！　よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "啊，是之前在演唱会上承蒙关照的工作人员……！\n这次还能再次合作呢！请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "1a2c605d0ed2a67f797a3df34201813516d31c753ebd20c686497e8254831a6a", "ja": "今回のミニライブ、\nよくお会いするスタッフさんが多いみたいね。", "zh": "这次的小型演唱会，好像有很多经常见面的工作人员呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "4e6a40904c2dc5158a1702fdaa24ad7af41505ee33411afd45b2332b41126dce", "ja": "そうですね。\n信頼できる方達ばかりで、心強いです。", "zh": "是啊。\n都是值得信赖的人，让人很安心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "ce5f2498deebd3aba596c3b9bc0761ea25fb3b39aacea6925a9ac9e1060655d7", "ja": "……ねえ、真。あの子、さっきからずっと\n真のこと見てるような気がするぞ。", "zh": "……那个，真。我觉得那孩子从刚才开始就一直在看着你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1009_newidol", "source_sha256": "fa734046ccfc273a41794082d40cdaedd6f9d8428f55b3531e5ff49109ad2f64", "ja": "ひゃっ……！", "zh": "呀……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1010_null", "source_sha256": "b4691b5c4ca1b05cfbd3b5bf3415948c6297782d1c6dd2277ea8074d1706cdd7", "ja": "ササッ", "zh": "唰", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "1a22747a6a1627e28b56addfd4d4cf7f5a18bebc7f26ecc5663f3ac6ce9795db", "ja": "隠れちゃったぞ……。\n緊張してるのかな？", "zh": "躲起来了哦……。\n是在紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "5e9e013af3804d7088be1de9ce0ca583b8855f987643c611260b7d3ab5a79134", "ja": "他のユニットの子だよね。\nよし、挨拶しにいこう！", "zh": "是其他组合的孩子吧。\n好，去打个招呼吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "eec1a502b35aba8b006e2bc6698d8c512e6a4c1bdc0320f1c31770260cf64299", "ja": "あの、はじめまして！\nボク、765プロの……。", "zh": "那个，你好，初次见面！\n我是765制作人的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1014_newidol", "source_sha256": "09449e8f6f7bc5b309982ce7c626d99c3e0c396178db5638445c67db985d39ef", "ja": "ひゃあっ……！", "zh": "呀……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "7c6749584c3477936a201e828434752755beb05cb2f5c2233595b89829f3308f", "ja": "あ、ごめんね。\n驚かせちゃったかな？", "zh": "啊，抱歉。\n是不是吓到你了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1016_newidol", "source_sha256": "a26f77de00234bb2d5921d24191a842530cef6da1aa7d7a0a6da07692174ebf2", "ja": "い、いえ！　違うんです……！　その……\n私、真さまに、ずっと憧れてて……。", "zh": "不、不是的！不是那样的……！那个……\n我一直都非常憧憬真大人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1017_newidol", "source_sha256": "566c302745a1dbdbf0d290ad8d5315bae79e1b70ecc29fb993c19f32ea85bdcb", "ja": "しかも、はじめてのライブだから、\nど、ドキドキしちゃって……！", "zh": "而且，这还是第一次登台演出，所以、所以紧张得心都怦怦跳……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "31988f317c60be40cd418717d7808b8a0e863c297736e21988cf11c411100c84", "ja": "そうだったんだ……。\nはじめてだと緊張しちゃうよね。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……  \n第一次上台的话，确实会紧张呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "4fa582194402d1ee8d18f0c7a8060b604cbf256aa99e00223a201c30dbe91fdb", "ja": "何かわからないことがあったら、なんでも聞いてね！\nライブ、一緒に頑張ろう！", "zh": "如果有什么不明白的，尽管来问我哦！\n演出也一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1020_newidol", "source_sha256": "d4ed86ec115e6511460f375e5e6ad5ae24fd54ba5066bbfffe243c255427eed4", "ja": "はっ、はいっ！　……あ、あの、同じユニットに、\n千早さまのファンの子たちもいるんですけど……。", "zh": "是、是的！……那、那个，我们组合里也有一些千早大人的粉丝……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1021_002chi", "source_sha256": "fc39b6e715259518deff6965627a8f39ea9fc1a591b624fe05977e43c6611d23", "ja": "え、私も……？", "zh": "诶，我也要……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1022_newidol", "source_sha256": "84177800a107e189c6c455f3857e3ca3fe861d2c5fc8acb5ad3d5cee69de5274", "ja": "はい。もしよかったら……なんですけど、あとで\n私たちと、お話とか……歌のアドバイスとか……。", "zh": "好的。如果您愿意的话……就是，待会儿要不要和我们聊聊天……或者给我们一些唱歌方面的建议……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1023_002chi", "source_sha256": "9b06a0ea240d9dbc3a8e6215bae53f0cd5ba3b881cb9b174718125e0410ed776", "ja": "……ええ。\n私でよければ、ぜひ。", "zh": "……嗯。\n如果您不介意的话，我很乐意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1024_newidol", "source_sha256": "48c3ef132d15f297cf61d9a3365433ea8cfe701711c3518ee8fe343ba3bda4d6", "ja": "本当ですかっ？　ありがとうございます……！\nみ、みんなに伝えてきます～っ！", "zh": "真的吗？！谢谢您……！\n我、我这就去告诉大家～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1025_se", "source_sha256": "9a7d8fa74f9cd6c067337bc7996cbc8595436fa84d66e7447d1cd2c21a36cc80", "ja": "スタタタタ……", "zh": "嗒嗒嗒嗒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1026_013hib", "source_sha256": "c358b5e784ebedbfa057e5c7059ec2774b1637c375c1f628557f9ceb6e4114ff", "ja": "……別に、うらやましくないぞ？", "zh": "……我可没有羡慕哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1027_006mak", "source_sha256": "c8ac823f5290b09321746045c6ca9434ef6d925ceae35df70c162473c0f75e5e", "ja": "わかってるってば……。", "zh": "我知道啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1028_010azu", "source_sha256": "5ececc21e306b42fa07dbd6f05104e202f5e93fc0c32d6167cdeb37d1a5191dd", "ja": "ふふっ、初々しくて、かわいいわね♪\nなんだか、劇場ができたばかりの頃みたい。", "zh": "呵呵，真是青涩又可爱呢♪\n总觉得就像剧场刚建成那时候一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1029_najiminosutaffu", "source_sha256": "05e7c301e34e90e5e3a92e22945aefd2d1491427cbb652614ae87489d00063f2", "ja": "まぁ、無理もありませんよ。さっきの子たちは\n少し前までアイドルファンだった新人ですから。", "zh": "这也难怪嘛。毕竟刚才那些孩子，\n是不久前还是偶像粉丝的新人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1030_006mak", "source_sha256": "15c674b6e7c72cdff292a35f8c863a7ec68e84b9e07c628a7242299db0b58166", "ja": "あ、さっきのスタッフさん……。\nそうなんですか？", "zh": "啊，是刚才的工作人员……\n原来是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1031_najiminosutaffu", "source_sha256": "46c2d2b1ea7d70746ea4180565fd1832574343111bbbbac936be34f0710959cd", "ja": "はい。メンバーの中で、菊地さん派と如月さん派に\n分かれてるそうです。", "zh": "好的。听说成员们分成了支持菊地小姐和支持如月小姐的两派。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1032_najiminosutaffu", "source_sha256": "c54b4ff94bef323c5d2b8ec47e80fea818cbe91a7ea9b0359045808a38160ae4", "ja": "他の新人の中にも、ファンが紛れてるみたいで。\nやっぱり、お二人のダンスと歌は別格なんでしょうね！", "zh": "其他新人里好像也混进了粉丝。\n果然，两位的舞蹈和歌声就是与众不同呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1033_006mak", "source_sha256": "f566ae946a7cd9c9ec5e899bd73267cc27f57b969491007dcdfdd606a7da9af9", "ja": "別格……！", "zh": "格外……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1034_002chi", "source_sha256": "d17a6bd59220d11e66722db253623c9101ebfaacabdb8f169006575586906a5a", "ja": "別格……。", "zh": "完全不是一个层次……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1035_002chi", "source_sha256": "0090e8876fefaffb48ef42e2372085fd0ce5a4fa12ea73268314a99034de64fd", "ja": "とんでもありません。\n私なんて、まだまだ未熟です。", "zh": "哪有的事。\n我还差得远呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1036_006mak", "source_sha256": "701b86a9ff34fbf16fbf802d0e80f84fc53bc50f670debff86907ace86920ae3", "ja": "ぼ、ボクもですよ！　……でも、別格かぁ……。\nえへ、えへへ♪", "zh": "我、我也是！……不过，完全是另一个级别啊……\n嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1037_010azu", "source_sha256": "7f78092f50c9cf70f23269ee6b665e62d9746bdfe1879f1008a729c1aaf182a5", "ja": "ふふっ、二人ともさすがね。\n私たちも誇らしいわ。ね、響ちゃん♪", "zh": "呵呵，你们两个不愧是你们呢。\n我们也觉得很自豪。对吧，响？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1038_013hib", "source_sha256": "403436bcf06b46d8ca0628f9a6d78b4be9858a1802895746c68ca91e2b005a77", "ja": "うぎゃーっ！　なんで真と千早ばっかり褒められる\nんだ！？　自分のファンの子はいないの～！？", "zh": "呜哇——！为什么总是在夸真和千早啊！？就没有喜欢我的粉丝吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1039_najiminosutaffu", "source_sha256": "91f7cf179776f73dd7bff178db6fdbdad7e184b5a097627f4ba41507eda07eab", "ja": "ああっ、すみません、今日はたまたまそういう日で！\nもちろんお二人のファンの子も業界にたくさん……！", "zh": "啊，抱歉，今天只是碰巧是这样的日子！\n当然，喜欢两位的粉丝在业内也有很多……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1040_najiminosutaffu", "source_sha256": "1fa932784bca4b94cb403e72bba91de0d93c0127973f8258fcd4c79b7460e49c", "ja": "あっと、そろそろ時間ですね。……コホン。\nそれでは、ミーティングを始めさせていただきまーす！", "zh": "哎呀，差不多到时间了呢。……咳咳。\n那么，会议现在开始啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1041_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1042_006mak", "source_sha256": "782e94dc996f292befc7d7dff5d9c6fa9ea391ec40e5ca7ca2f951dcfcaa1457", "ja": "ミーティング、楽しかったね！\n出演者のみんなとも、いっぱい話せたし。", "zh": "会议很开心呢！\n也和所有演出者聊了好多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1043_013hib", "source_sha256": "4a604243b3dbb07beaa06f1770cd7879b351b63bc68a7ca0b61ebf06e24d5e25", "ja": "自分はまだ悔しいぞ……。\n自分だって……自分だって！　うぎぎぎぎ～！", "zh": "我还是不甘心啊……我也……我也想要！呜呜呜呜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1044_002chi", "source_sha256": "6cfaef6f61960252a8199961055292664ea08d905f2816ae4495b46f9fbace58", "ja": "……。\n私は、我那覇さんのそういうところ、すごいと思う。", "zh": "……。\n我很佩服我那霸同学的这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1045_013hib", "source_sha256": "a6b36ef251125340951dcdf88efda34b63d89ef604142e97b829faad6167b493", "ja": "えっ？　なんで？\nすごいって言われてたのは、千早と真でしょ？", "zh": "诶？为什么？\n被说很厉害的不是千早和真吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1046_006mak", "source_sha256": "29e849ff3d7380d3946c61d73667ef449de92de01c93302a8a322c0aa470591d", "ja": "……あはは。ボクも千早の言ってること、\nなんとなくわかるかも。", "zh": "……啊哈哈。我好像也有点明白千早说的话了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1047_006mak", "source_sha256": "ee3b31e129cda78e3ac8d00313f7387e176e630b33f59c2feb1645101654781e", "ja": "悔しい、負けたくないって気持ちを素直に出せるのって\n大事なことだよね。ボクたちアイドルには。", "zh": "能坦率地表达出不甘心、不想输的心情，对我们偶像来说也是很重要的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1048_002chi", "source_sha256": "2f3b905fbaf6adce021b22b32b200f7bf32a45e88292080788714e97c0753f52", "ja": "ええ。それに、『別格』だなんて……\n寂しい言葉に聞こえて。", "zh": "是啊。而且，说什么“格外特别”……听起来也是个令人寂寞的词。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1049_002chi", "source_sha256": "50a50a209f8b7332cc5e0384aed25ef8caaad7e8a6f57cd7252f2dce7bc6adac", "ja": "私は……。\n隣で歌いたい、って……言ってもらえた方が。", "zh": "我……\n如果能听到有人对我说“想在身边歌唱”……会更好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1050_010azu", "source_sha256": "5ba7b84203a0ad70a484506ea4c4e80ed90548cdfbf47f5fa4c6955ab8a6a8e7", "ja": "……そうね。私たち4人でしっかり歌いましょう。\nお互いに負けないように、しっかりと。", "zh": "……也是呢。我们4个人好好地唱吧。\n为了不输给彼此，认真地唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1051_002chi", "source_sha256": "58b8233dc4af1f432fb0f5d066febe549adcb6f9c159814f25be0359672ea35d", "ja": "……はい。負けないように、一緒に。", "zh": "……好。为了不输给彼此，一起努力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1052_013hib", "source_sha256": "b0f75969a5b01aa1fa63228ffc48af2e175cb10aa05b0e673c7b59f5104726e8", "ja": "うん！　じゃあそのためにも、今から一緒に特訓さー！\nみんな、自分について来てよね！", "zh": "嗯！那为了这个，现在就一起特训吧——！\n大家可要跟上我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_03_1053_006mak", "source_sha256": "45d306ff569b4958f00be0a2956cb53b0b22ee7842367578e1db5017dadf9edc", "ja": "えっ、今から！？\nちょっと、待ってよ、響～！", "zh": "诶，现在就开始！？  \n等一下啦，响～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
